  "limitations": [
    "Baseline lifecycle timing did not enclose the synchronous viewport.add_child(view) call, so BattleView._ready cost is not separately measured. The after-run script now times it as view_add_child_ready_ms; that field is not comparable to this baseline.",
    "The first benchmark sample in each stage records process-frame and drawn-frame delta 0; all subsequent samples record delta 1. This is the one bootstrap-boundary sample, not two awaited frames.",
    "B12 is an intentionally dense fixture with ordinary-enemy HP x8 and boss gate deferred. Enemy AI, attacks, collisions, movement, party damage and skill requests remain active. Party HP x10 is also a fixture adjustment.",
    "A fixed 1280x720 NVIDIA RTX 5080 / OpenGL compatibility workload is device-specific; it does not guarantee all user systems have the same frame times."
  ]
}
